cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this pipeline, cite the software entry below. If you use the fragment
  scans, cite the Zenodo dataset under references as well.
title: Fragment Descriptor Pipeline
abstract: >-
  Extracts geometric and surface descriptors from 3D scans of demolition concrete
  fragments and structures them into one queryable record per fragment. Geometric
  descriptors are computed deterministically and verified; surface feature labels
  come from a vision-language model and are reported as provisional, having been
  scored against two hand-labelled tile sets without exceeding a null baseline.
type: software
